[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10994.309, "timestamp": "03:03:14", "text": "兄弟。我是最后一个。快点。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10996.34, "timestamp": "03:03:16", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11002.75, "timestamp": "03:03:22", "text": "什么？嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11005.67, "timestamp": "03:03:25", "text": "另外，我大概能玩一两局。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11007.59, "timestamp": "03:03:27", "text": "迅速出击。然后我就得走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11010.55, "timestamp": "03:03:30", "text": "因为我还没吃饭。哦，你还没吃饭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11012.469, "timestamp": "03:03:32", "text": "午餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11015.83, "timestamp": "03:03:35", "text": "我还没吃早饭。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11017.91, "timestamp": "03:03:37", "text": "是的。再见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11020.63, "timestamp": "03:03:40", "text": "你什么时候醒的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11023.03, "timestamp": "03:03:43", "text": "你告诉我你醒来的时候就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11026.229, "timestamp": "03:03:46", "text": "大概两点左右吧？是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11029.11, "timestamp": "03:03:49", "text": "在那之前，我必须在……起床。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11032.95, "timestamp": "03:03:52", "text": "早上8:30我的会议，然后就结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11036.15, "timestamp": "03:03:56", "text": "上午 10:00。所以我又在晚上10点半睡了。"}]